## 11. Execution hand-off checklist

1. Freeze pre-registration: copy §3.2 slot inventory, §3.4 exclusion set + defaults, and the
   §5.1 verdict rule into the artifact's §1 **before** opening any source file. Record
   `pre_registration_frozen_at`.
2. `LOCATE` for G1–G3: resolve each review doc to the goal's full sealed artifact set; log
   every artifact as found/not-found (the not-found log is required evidence for
   `absent-out-of-corpus`).
3. Apply the §7.1 diversity guard; add G4 if and only if it triggers.
4. `EXTRACT` + `SCORE` per goal into the §6.1 field-ledger table. One row per
   (node_instance, slot). Every `extractable` carries a quotable locus.
5. Second, blind extraction of G3; compute `agreement_rate` (§5.3).
6. Compute `D`, `N`, `loss_ratio`, `loss_ratio_all_slots`, `loss_ratio_in_source` (§4); show
   the arithmetic.
7. Evaluate C1–C4 individually, then the verdict. Set `verdict_basis` per §5.4.
8. Write `reviews/spikes/sakg-s1-extraction-probe.md` to the §6.1 schema; run the §6.2
   self-test; report its actual output.
9. Record §7.3 findings as proposals. **Do not edit `spec/SAEOS-1-architecture.md`.**

